		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b7a0123 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="6b7a0123" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-186d8406 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="186d8406" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-76d3efd4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="76d3efd4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why "just market my salon" <span class="hl">is the wrong brief</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-11e9c789 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="11e9c789" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-43c81964 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="43c81964" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-34b6a1c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="34b6a1c9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>&#8220;Beauty salon&#8221; covers at least four genuinely different business models in the UAE — <a href="/hair-salons/">hair salons</a>, beauty parlours, <a href="/barber-shops/">barbershops</a>, and unisex salons — and each one makes money differently. Marketing them identically means underselling whichever one your salon actually is.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1319b75f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1319b75f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Volume formats and ticket-value formats need opposite messaging</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3d43f278 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3d43f278" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A barbershop&#8217;s economics depend on rapid chair turnover and daily client count, so &#8220;next available slot&#8221; and instant booking convert best. A ladies parlour or hair salon depends on higher ticket value per visit and fewer rotations, so bundled packages and service comparisons convert better than speed-of-booking messaging.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5f85200c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5f85200c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Unisex salons carry the hardest marketing brief in the category</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-28b00a7f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="28b00a7f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Running a fast walk-in tier and a premium appointment tier under one roof means your booking flow, ad messaging and even review-request timing have to be segmented by service type — a genuinely different challenge from a single-format salon.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-314bd6e4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="314bd6e4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-93f7da4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="93f7da4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Beauty salons, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">4+ formats</b><span>— hair, beauty parlour, barbershop, unisex, each with different economics</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">AED 70-2,200</b><span>— typical Dubai price spread across formats and tiers (Glowth estimate)</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">30 min &#8211; 3+ hrs</b><span>— visit length range across the category</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Weekend peak</b><span>— a demand pattern we see across most formats (Glowth observation)</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-58d9b078 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="58d9b078" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
