14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #0e0d12;">Multi-location support</div><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #0ba05f; font-weight: bold;">Per-branch local SEO</div><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #d23f63; font-weight: bold;">One page for all locations</div></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr; font-size: 13.5px; background: #fff;"><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #0e0d12;">Reporting</div><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #0ba05f; font-weight: bold;">Bookings &amp; rebookings, by format</div><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #d23f63; font-weight: bold;">Clicks &amp; impressions</div></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr; font-size: 13.5px; background: #FBFAFE;"><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #0e0d12;">Contract lock-in</div><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #0ba05f; font-weight: bold;">None — monthly rolling</div><div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E6EC; color: #d23f63; font-weight: bold;">Often 6–12 months</div></div>								</div>
				</div>
