		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1efa4f47 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="1efa4f47" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2068356a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2068356a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33a7c129 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="33a7c129" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="text-align:center;font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>FAQs</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3a03e806 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3a03e806" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Beauty salon marketing — <span class="hl">before you ask</span></h2>				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5727217f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5727217f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-daffafd elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion" data-id="daffafd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="accordion.default">
							<div class="elementor-accordion">
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-2291" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="1" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-2291" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Why does my salon's "format" matter for marketing?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-2291" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-2291"><p>Because a barbershop&#8217;s revenue depends on fast chair turnover and daily volume, while a ladies parlour or hair salon depends on higher ticket value per visit — the messaging, booking flow and ad strategy that work for one can actively hurt the other.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-2292" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="2" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-2292" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">We're a unisex salon — do you split our marketing by service side?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-2292" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-2292"><p>Yes — unisex salons need a dual-tier approach: fast &#8220;book now&#8221; messaging for walk-in services and more detailed, consultation-style content for premium appointment-only services, under one consistent brand.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-2293" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="3" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-2293" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How is this different from your Ladies Salons page?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-2293" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-2293"><p>Ladies Salons covers women-only salons specifically — privacy, female staff and how that changes your marketing. This page covers the broader salon category — hair salons, beauty parlours, barbershops, and unisex/mixed-gender salons — each with its own distinct business model. If your clientele is defined by language or treatment style, see our pages on <a href="/arabic-beauty-salon/">marketing an Arabic beauty salon</a>, <a href="/korean-beauty-salon/">K-beauty salon marketing</a> and <a href="/russian-beauty-salon/">reaching Russian-speaking clients</a>.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-2294" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="4" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-2294" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">We have multiple branches — can you handle that?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-2294" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-2294"><p>Yes — we rank each branch individually for its own neighborhood searches on Google Maps while keeping brand messaging and review management consistent across all locations.</p></div>
				</div>
